{"v":1,"file":"nortek-split-air-conditioner-973f-technical.pdf","pages":["Delivering Comfort WITH THE FSA3BF SERIES OF AIR CONDITIONERS","Table of Contents 2 CONTRACTOR SUPPORT 3 PRODUCT FEATURES & BENEFITS 4 TECHNICAL SPECIFICATIONS - MODEL ID CODES - AIR CONDITIONER OUTDOOR SECTION DIMENSIONS - AIR DISCHARGE ALLOWS ADEQUATE CLEARANCE FOR AIRFLOW 5 PHYSICAL AND ELECTRICAL SPECIFICATIONS/OUTDOOR UNITS AND ACCESSORIES 6 SYSTEM COOLING CAPACITIES 7 COOLING EXPANDED RATINGS WITH VARIABLE SPEED BLOWER 1","THE FRIGIDAIRE® Designed with contractors in mind. Frigidaire HVAC equipment is designed with the contractor in mind. Each unit is equipped with features designed to make them easier to install and service, reducing time spent on each job while ensuring peak performance and safety. EASY TO EASY TO Service Install 2","FSA3BF Series Extra-High Efficiency Air Conditioner | Up to 15.2 SEER2 Residential System | 2 – 5 Ton Capacity The FSA3BF Series of air conditioners offers exceptional performance. The unit, when combined with our engineered coils or air handlers, offers a full line of quality, split system cooling equipment. Easy to Service Easy to Install 1 REMOVABLE SIDE PANELS Side panels can be easily removed and replaced without removing the top grill. 2 EASY TO CLEAN COIL All aluminum coils provide high corrosion resistance. Innovative design decreases unit weight and refrigerant requirements. 3 GALVANIZED STEEL EXTERIOR Powder-coated paint and gloss finish eliminates sharp edges and reduces scratching. 4 QR CODES QR codes on each unit link directly to the product’s technical literature, eliminating the need to search for relevant documentation when working on the unit. 5 INCLUDED FILTER DRIER Liquid line filter drier included with unit, field installed. 6 LONG WIRING LEADS Easy to service fan motors. 3","MODEL ID CODES F S A 3 B F 4 M 2 S N 24 K Jacket Style Split System A - Air Conditioner H - Heat Pump Design Series B - Brazed D - 13.4 SEER2 E - 14.3 SEER2 F - 15